@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# admin-service
+
+Admin service provides tenant-level administrative actions and audit trails.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Execute privileged user-management actions.
+- Persist immutable audit events for admin actions.
+- Serve audit history for tenant administrators.
+
+## Auth model
+Relies on gateway-injected headers:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+Allowed write/read roles: `ADMIN`, `SYSTEM`.
+
+## API
+- `PATCH /api/v1/admin/users/{userId}/status`
+- `GET /api/v1/admin/audits`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
