diff --git a/api-gateway/README.md b/api-gateway/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..84525513083c8d0ac7ce510030608414945a1a26
--- /dev/null
+++ b/api-gateway/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# API Gateway (Step 2)
+
+Spring Cloud Gateway service for routing, authentication enforcement, and rate limiting.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Central entry point for all client applications
+- Routes traffic to downstream microservices
+- Validates JWT by calling auth-service `/api/v1/auth/validate`
+- Injects identity headers to downstream services:
+  - `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+  - `X-Authenticated-Role`
+  - `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+- Applies Redis-backed request rate limiting
+
+## Public Routes
+These are bypassed by authentication filter:
+- `/api/v1/auth/**`
+- `/actuator/health`
+- `/v3/api-docs/**`
+- `/swagger-ui/**`
+
+## Example Route Mapping
+- `/api/v1/auth/**` -> `http://localhost:8081`
+- `/api/v1/users/**` -> `http://localhost:8082`
+- `/api/v1/vendors/**` -> `http://localhost:8083`
+- `/api/v1/products/**` -> `http://localhost:8084`
+- `/api/v1/orders/**` -> `http://localhost:8085`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd api-gateway
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd api-gateway
+mvn test
+```
