@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# Cart Service (Step 7)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for Redis-backed cart management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Maintain user cart in Redis
+- Add/update/remove cart items
+- Return cart totals (items and subtotal)
+- Clear cart after checkout or user action
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `GET /api/v1/cart/me`
+- `POST /api/v1/cart/items`
+- `PUT /api/v1/cart/items/{productId}`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/cart/items/{productId}`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/cart/me`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd cart-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd cart-service
+mvn test
+```
