--- /dev/null
+++ b/delivery-service/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+# Delivery Service (Step 10)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for delivery partner onboarding, assignment, and tracking.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Manage delivery partner profiles
+- Create delivery tasks for orders
+- Assign delivery partners
+- Track and update delivery status
+- Expose deliveries to customer/partner/admin views
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `PUT /api/v1/deliveries/partners/me`
+- `POST /api/v1/deliveries`
+- `POST /api/v1/deliveries/{deliveryId}/assign`
+- `PATCH /api/v1/deliveries/{deliveryId}/status`
+- `GET /api/v1/deliveries/{deliveryId}`
+- `GET /api/v1/deliveries/me`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd delivery-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd delivery-service
+mvn test
+```
