@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# Inventory Service (Step 6)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for stock management, reservation, and offline sale tracking.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Vendor stock-in operations
+- Stock reservation/release during order lifecycle
+- Offline sale recording (stock deduction)
+- Inventory movement audit trail
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `POST /api/v1/inventory/stock-in`
+- `POST /api/v1/inventory/reserve`
+- `POST /api/v1/inventory/release`
+- `POST /api/v1/inventory/offline-sale`
+- `GET /api/v1/inventory/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/inventory/{inventoryId}/movements`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd inventory-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd inventory-service
+mvn test
+```
