+# Notification Service (Step 11)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for notification creation, delivery tracking, and user inbox retrieval.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Create notifications for platform events
+- Track notification delivery/read status
+- Expose per-user notification inbox
+- Provide tenant-wide notification visibility for admin/system roles
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `POST /api/v1/notifications`
+- `PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{notificationId}/status`
+- `GET /api/v1/notifications/{notificationId}`
+- `GET /api/v1/notifications/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/notifications`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd notification-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd notification-service
+mvn test
+```
