@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Order Service (Step 8)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for order creation and lifecycle management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Create customer orders from cart-like payloads
+- Persist order items and financial totals
+- Expose customer/vendor/admin order retrieval
+- Support order status transitions
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `POST /api/v1/orders`
+- `GET /api/v1/orders/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/orders/{orderId}`
+- `PATCH /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/status`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd order-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd order-service
+mvn test
+```
