@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# Payment Service (Step 9)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for payment processing and refund management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Create payment records for orders
+- Update payment status from gateway/webhook-like callbacks
+- Process full/partial refunds
+- Expose payment history per user
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `POST /api/v1/payments`
+- `PATCH /api/v1/payments/{paymentId}/status`
+- `POST /api/v1/payments/{paymentId}/refunds`
+- `GET /api/v1/payments/{paymentId}`
+- `GET /api/v1/payments/me`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd payment-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd payment-service
+mvn test
+```
