diff --git a/product-service/README.md b/product-service/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..6ca3b61a0d81e90eaf4b50f6797e6a57a9f8875e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/product-service/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+# Product Service (Step 5)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for catalog/category management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Category management
+- Vendor-scoped product management
+- Product attribute management
+- Tenant-scoped product retrieval
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `POST /api/v1/categories`
+- `GET /api/v1/categories`
+- `POST /api/v1/products`
+- `PUT /api/v1/products/{productId}`
+- `GET /api/v1/products/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/products/{productId}`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/products/{productId}`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd product-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd product-service
+mvn test
+```
