diff --git a/search-service/README.md b/search-service/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..bed4d0614e4e6af27a0abe84708426dc142770ac
--- /dev/null
+++ b/search-service/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# search-service
+
+Search service indexes tenant-scoped product metadata and serves keyword/category/price lookups.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Upsert searchable product documents.
+- Query indexed products by keyword/category/price range.
+- Soft delete index entries.
+
+## Auth model
+Relies on gateway-injected headers:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## API
+- `POST /api/v1/search/index`
+- `GET /api/v1/search/products?q=milk&category=grocery&minPrice=10&maxPrice=100&limit=20`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/search/index/{productId}`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
