@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# User Service (Step 3)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for customer profile management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Manage customer profile (`/api/v1/users/me`)
+- Manage customer addresses (`/api/v1/users/me/addresses`)
+- Maintain user preferences JSON payload
+- Enforce tenant-scoped profile and address operations
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `GET /api/v1/users/me`
+- `PUT /api/v1/users/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/users/me/addresses`
+- `POST /api/v1/users/me/addresses`
+- `PUT /api/v1/users/me/addresses/{addressId}`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/users/me/addresses/{addressId}`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd user-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd user-service
+mvn test
+```
