--- /dev/null
+++ b/vendor-service/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# Vendor Service (Step 4)
+
+Spring Boot microservice for vendor onboarding and profile/location management.
+
+## Responsibilities
+- Vendor profile onboarding/update
+- Vendor store location management (latitude/longitude)
+- Vendor self-service deactivation
+- Tenant-scoped vendor lookups
+
+## Authentication Model
+This service expects identity headers from API Gateway:
+- `X-Authenticated-UserId`
+- `X-Authenticated-Role`
+- `X-Authenticated-TenantId`
+
+## APIs
+- `GET /api/v1/vendors/me`
+- `PUT /api/v1/vendors/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/vendors/me/location`
+- `PUT /api/v1/vendors/me/location`
+- `DELETE /api/v1/vendors/me`
+- `GET /api/v1/vendors/{vendorId}`
+
+## Run
+```bash
+cd vendor-service
+mvn spring-boot:run
+```
+
+## Test
+```bash
+cd vendor-service
+mvn test
+```
